5
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:28.070
Technology is changing fast, and it is changing at its foundations.

6
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.710
The driver is artificial intelligence.

7
00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:36.670
Since last week, the US government calls it superintelligence

8
00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.270
