15
00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:12.710
The pace is not going to slow down, and the race is on.

16
00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.750
It is a race for national competitive advantage.

17
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:21.310
In President Trump's own words, "Whoever wins superintelligence

18
00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:27.560
