23
00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:49.310
We need to find a different way to compete.

24
00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.950
We need to find our way.

25
00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.190
This is what this forum is about.

26
00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.880
From problems and recommendations that together we are going to

27
00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:06.040
