29
00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:15.920
workforce skills, innovation financing,

30
00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:20.550
cybersecurity, and cooperation across the Black Sea region.

31
00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.840
It is a perfect storm, and we need to find our way to navigate across

32
00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.720
